부(지자체는 시범양식 참여 어업인 명단)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="125" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="202"><CHAR>                  * 어업권 현황(허가·면허번호, 유효기간) 필수 포함(서식 2-1)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="125" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="195"><CHAR>              3. 지방비 확보 및 자부담 능력을 증명할 수 있는 증빙서류 1부</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="129" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="147"><CHAR>주1) 해당 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="185"><CHAR>□ 에 “</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="203"><CHAR>√” 표시 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="147"/></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="116" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="147"><TABLE BorderFill="6" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1184686372" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" TextWrap="TopAndBottom" ZOrder="43"><SIZE Height="2731" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="47969" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="15" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2731" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="6439"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="60" Style="19"><TEXT CharShape="204"><CHAR>서식 2-1</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="16" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2731" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="848"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext=